# The editor SPA is a real directory entry (editor/index.html), so /editor/ is served by any
# static host without rewrites. The explicit lines cover deep links — and hosts whose routing
# skips directory-index resolution once rewrites are defined (Vercel does). Everything else
# keeps real 404s — the landing pages are static and need no SPA fallback.
/editor    /editor/index.html    200
/editor/   /editor/index.html    200
/editor/*  /editor/index.html    200
